h:1px\">\n<p>The African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) is a pan-African network of Centres of Excellence for post-graduate training in mathematical sciences, research and public engagement in Science, Technology, Engineering and Mathematics (STEM). AIMS is enabling Africa\u2019s talented students to become innovators driving the continent\u2019s scientific, educational and economic self-sufficiency.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-button alignnone\"><a class=\"wp-block-advgb-button_link advgbbtn-3abf7ab8-194f-425c-871f-81427a70d47a\" href=\"..\/alumni-wall\/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Alumni Wall<\/span><\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px;width:6px;background-color:#D56E4E\"> <\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"has-gray-color has-text-color\"><\/h2>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 bg-alt\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"has-white-color has-text-color\">News and Blog Posts<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n     \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid \">\n\n    <div class=\"row mx-auto my-auto\">\n        <div id=\"newsCarousel\" class=\"carousel is-relative slide w-100\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n              <a class=\"carousel-control-prev \" href=\"#newsCarousel\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n                <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n            <a class=\"carousel-control-next \" href=\"#newsCarousel\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n                <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Next<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n            <div class=\"carousel-inner is-relative w-100\" >\n       \n   \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n\n <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-inner shadow25\">\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"blog-card-top img-bg \" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-11-170913.png )\"> <div class=\"article-tag post\">  <\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-card-bottom pad-5\"> \n\n    <h3 class=\"center-text\"> AIMS Ghana Hosts Mastercard Foundation Team for Engagement Session with 2025\/26 Scholars <\/h3>\n    \n     <p>The African Institute for Mathematical Sciences &#8211; AIMS, Ghana on November 5, 2025, hosted the Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program team for an interactive engagement session with the 2025\/2026 cohort of&#8230;<\/p>                <a data-no-translation aria-label=AIMS Ghana Hosts Mastercard Foundation Team for Engagement Session with 2025\/26 Scholars href='https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/aims-ghana-hosts-mastercard-foundation-team-for-engagement-session-with-2025-scholars\/' aria-label=\"AIMS Ghana Hosts Mastercard Foundation Team for Engagement Session with 2025\/26 Scholars\" title='Read Full Article' class=link-button> Read More <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n\n <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-inner shadow25\">\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"blog-card-top img-bg \" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-09-23-100400.png )\"> <div class=\"article-tag post\">  <\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-card-bottom pad-5\"> \n\n    <h3 class=\"center-text\"> Call for AIMS Ghana Masters Research Project Supervisors <\/h3>\n    \n     <p>The African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) Ghana invites qualified researchers and academics to supervise student research projects for the upcoming research phases of our Master\u2019s programs. 1. MSc in&#8230;<\/p>                <a data-no-translation aria-label=Call for AIMS Ghana Masters Research Project Supervisors href='https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/call-for-aims-ghana-masters-research-project-supervisors\/' aria-label=\"Call for AIMS Ghana Masters Research Project Supervisors\" title='Read Full Article' class=link-button> Read More <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n\n <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-inner shadow25\">\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"blog-card-top img-bg \" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-27-092421.png )\"> <div class=\"article-tag post\">  <\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-card-bottom pad-5\"> \n\n    <h3 class=\"center-text\"> The Next Generation of Change-Makers: AIMS Ghana Welcomes 25\/26 Cohort of Mastercard Foundation Scholars into the Program <\/h3>\n    \n     <p>The African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) Ghana has officially welcomed 35 new students including 14 women, into the Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program with an orientation session, marking the start&#8230;<\/p>                <a data-no-translation aria-label=The Next Generation of Change-Makers: AIMS Ghana Welcomes 25\/26 Cohort of Mastercard Foundation Scholars into the Program href='https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/aims-ghana-welcomes-25-26-cohort-of-mastercard-foundation-scholars-into-the-program\/' aria-label=\"The Next Generation of Change-Makers: AIMS Ghana Welcomes 25\/26 Cohort of Mastercard Foundation Scholars into the Program\" title='Read Full Article' class=link-button> Read More <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n\n <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-inner shadow25\">\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"blog-card-top img-bg \" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/10\/Qualaria.png )\"> <div class=\"article-tag post\">  <\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-card-bottom pad-5\"> \n\n    <h3 class=\"center-text\"> Advancing Science Diplomacy through Quantum Innovation: AIMS Ghana at the GESDA Summit 2025 <\/h3>\n    \n     <p>At the global nexus of science, diplomacy, and societal transformation, AIMS Ghana made a remarkable impression at the Geneva Science and Diplomacy Anticipator (GESDA) Summit 2025, held from 15\u201317 October&#8230;<\/p>                <a data-no-translation aria-label=Advancing Science Diplomacy through Quantum Innovation: AIMS Ghana at the GESDA Summit 2025 href='https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/aims-ghana-participates-in-the-gesda-2025-advancing-science-diplomacy-through-quantum-innovation\/' aria-label=\"Advancing Science Diplomacy through Quantum Innovation: AIMS Ghana at the GESDA Summit 2025\" title='Read Full Article' class=link-button> Read More <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n\n <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-inner shadow25\">\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"blog-card-top img-bg \" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/10\/princess-peal.png )\"> <div class=\"article-tag post\">  <\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-card-bottom pad-5\"> \n\n    <h3 class=\"center-text\"> Gender-responsive mentorship nurturing a pipeline of women in STEM: Princess Pearl Amanie\u2019s journey from the AIMS GMSP to an AIMS Master\u2019s student <\/h3>\n    \n     <p>In 2021, Princess Pearl Amanie joined the Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program (GMSP) at the African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS), Ghana, as part of the first-ever cohort. At the&#8230;<\/p>                <a data-no-translation aria-label=Gender-responsive mentorship nurturing a pipeline of women in STEM: Princess Pearl Amanie\u2019s journey from the AIMS GMSP to an AIMS Master\u2019s student href='https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/gender-responsive-mentorship-nurturing-a-pipeline-of-women-in-stem-princess-pearl-amanies-journey-from-the-aims-gmsp-to-an-aims-masters-student\/' aria-label=\"Gender-responsive mentorship nurturing a pipeline of women in STEM: Princess Pearl Amanie\u2019s journey from the AIMS GMSP to an AIMS Master\u2019s student\" title='Read Full Article' class=link-button> Read More <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n\n <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 blog-card\"><div class=\"blog-card-inner shadow25\">\n\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"blog-card-top img-bg \" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-27-173742.png )\"> <div class=\"article-tag post\">  <\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-card-bottom pad-5\"> \n\n    <h3 class=\"center-text\"> Empowering Tomorrow\u2019s Innovators: Orientation for the Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program Marks International Day of the Girl Child <\/h3>\n    \n     <p>In celebration of the International Day of the Girl Child, the African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) Ghana hosted an inspiring virtual orientation for Cohort 4 of the Girls in&#8230;<\/p>                <a data-no-translation aria-label=Empowering Tomorrow\u2019s Innovators: Orientation for the Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program Marks International Day of the Girl Child href='https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/empowering-tomorrows-innovators-orientation-for-the-girls-in-mathematical-sciences-program-marks-international-day-of-the-girl-child\/' aria-label=\"Empowering Tomorrow\u2019s Innovators: Orientation for the Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program Marks International Day of the Girl Child\" title='Read Full Article' class=link-button> Read More <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  \n      \n\n\n\n            <\/div>\n         \n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div c